Everything which has become static needs to be recreated.
There is room for all kinds of improvisations, re-editions and unforeseen events or full of audacity.
The risk consists in abandoning something that is archaic, to pull off an old mask from your face, to stop doing what you have been doing up to now, to move on, to change your role. In conclusion, from 2004 onwards, the challenge consists in getting rid of your old garment and putting on a new one…
Friends, social life and projects
For many years your aspirations, your vision of yourself, your friendships and your projects dissolve and return to your mind with the intention of permeating your ideas. In 2009, this will be underlined with the appearance of new energetic currents which will cooperate in visualizing yourself in a more vital and optimist light in the future.
You will renew your social and cultural values. Warning: do not stimulate illusions where there is no basis. Simply absorb and copy the models of success, prestige and trends, and stay alert for the opportunities that your milieu affords…
Money, work and professional life
