The lunar eclipse on the 9th of February will have an effect on fraternal relationships, travel, study, treaties, negotiations, contracts, legal matters, with other regions, with in-laws or with the surroundings.
Advise: you now embrace and include that which you previously left out. Focus on that which is best, but first measure your real possibilities. It is an excellent moment to harmonize and repair a relationship which is important.
