Vocational orientation for the youth and adults
This field of Astrology counsels adolescents in search of a professional career, occupation or service to the community and to adults in need of professional reorientation or new options.
To know who we are and to define where we are going, focuses and strengthens the development of our resources, of our performance in society and the construction of objectives.
Not knowing ourselves is a problem that not only young people possess, but is also true of many adults. In the face of disorientation, disconnection or dissatisfaction, Astrology is a tool which aids in recognizing and valuing our strengths and weaknesses.
