Today we have the pleasure to announce you that we have concluded a favored partnership agreement.
When the best of two worlds come together...
... you benefit from the expertise of two leading companies
Together, Pattyn Packing Lines and De La Ballina Industrie have years of unique knowledge and experience in order to provide you innovative, cost-effective and complete bread and pastry packaging solutions.
The solutions enable you to increase the efficiency and productivity of your packaging process and to enhance your global competitiveness.
The Pattyn Group, already consisting of Pattyn Packing Lines and Pattyn North America LLC, complements the successful growth strategy with the acquisition of De La Ballina Industrie and its Canadian and German subsidiaries.
The acquisition was in keeping with the Group's strategy to increase customer share in the frozen bread industry and to ensure our leading position.
One complete solution, one single source contact
Pattyn Packing Lines has more than 30 years of international experience in complete and automatic case lining solutions.
We guarantee the very best handling and packaging of your bulk products into lined cases or trays. Today we support more than 600 customers worldwide, from small and midsize companies to global industrial companies.
De La Ballina Industrie has more than 15 years of experience in automatic counting and packaging lines with artificial vision for your frozen dough, parbaked, baked, fresh or frozen bakery products, confectionery or pastry products and has more than 200 customers in 50 countries.
How our smart solutions will make your business grow
Together we support you to solve your packaging problems by offering the most efficient solutions to count, weigh, organise, control, fill and pack your bread or pastry products into lined cases. We provide both semi-automated packaging lines, where high flexibility is required, and fully automated lines with artificial vision.
We bring together years of knowledge and experience in order to provide you:
Success in a global market with turn-key solutions from one single source supplier,
Expertise, know-how and assistance in realising your packaging project,
Efficient coordination, project management and implementation,
Continuity of your packaging line, thanks to our worldwide support.
More information:
Visit delaballina.com or pattyn.com and stay up to date with the latest innovations in bread counting and packaging.
