The AXIORA.com has been developed following accessible design and programming criteria, in order to guarantee universal access for the greatest possible number of users, independent of the platform or device employed to access the site.
These criteria are based on the WCAG/WAI recommendations of the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C), an international consortium that develops Internet technologies and standards. Level AA of said recommendation has been applied, and where this has not been possible, a minimum of level A has been employed, or in any event XHTML and CSS2 technologies have been used.
Use of standards and device independence
The source code for this website has been developed using XHTML and CSS2 technologies, as recommended by W3C for the proper display of navigation devices, and the correct separation between style and content.
Thereby, the content of the AXIORA.com website can be represented by any browser, operating system or device that supports the XHTML standard for web page representation. Likewise, all navigation mechanisms have been prepared for use on different platforms, independent of input device.
Text and interface sizes
Following the recommendations of the WCAG specification, all font sizes and other site elements have been implemented using relative units. Therefore sizes can be modified using native browser controls.
In addition to the corresponding menus, these can be accessed directly via the following shortcuts::
The use of relative units also ensures the full adaptation of content to different screen sizes and types, in addition to different browser platforms.
Direct content access and navigation
Users that employ text browsers or screen readers can browse content directly via the links at the start of each page.
All contents of the web site AXIORA.com are available in both Spanish, English and Portuguese being parts of it in other languages.
If you want to change the current language in the website, just select Português English Español in the top right frame of the page, over the AXIORA.com logo.
You can consult legal information refered to this site through the link "Legal and privacy policies" located in the lower section of the pages of AXIORA.com website.
