The Accommodation
The house
The holiday house "Unterweger - Turk" was built in 1818th To the main house includes a large terrace and a garden (right on Möllfluss) with a garden house (living room, basement, bathroom).
The apartments
60 - 70 m² in size, have
- 1 (2 or 3) bedroom
- Central heating.
Bed linen, towels and tea towels are provided free of charge.
Garage and parking spaces in front of the house. Pets (dogs, cats) are allowed.
The property owner is open year round.
Children under 12 stay free!
Summer festivals, concerts and popular events with the local brass band, the singing and traditional societies, sunset drinks, games and comedy museum in the castle Porcia in Spittal / Drau, Library.
Two cable cars take you into the higher regions of the Reisseck (2300 m) and the Kreuzeck (1200 m).
Well maintained, marked hiking - and cycling in the valley and high altitude (150 km), acquisition of hiking needles possible.
The central location allows almost all types of fun sports such as:
Rafting, paragliding, hiking, mountaineering, rock climbing, mountain biking (bike rental in the community), riding in the surrounding horse farms.
Swimming in pools of Kolbnitz, Obervellach and Spittal, and in the nearby lake and Millstätter Weissensee. Here there are also all other kinds of water-sports such as waterskiing, diving and fishing or just quiet boating (boat rental), and trips on the lakes.
Tennis and sports courts are in Kolbnitz and Obervellach.
In winter, skiing and snowboarding available in neighboring areas of the glacier and the Mölltaler Ankogel. There is also a ski lift in the valley (in Raunigwiese Kolbnitz) for beginners, a toboggan run, cross country ski trails, skating rinks, indoor pool and saunas.
