The energetic and material use of renewable raw materials gives access to self-contained recycling systems along the lines of sustainable development.
TRIANGEL offers adjusted all-in solutions where the positive effects are an integral component in the cultivation and utilisation of renewable raw materials:
Renewable raw materials are essentially C02-neutral. Their use generates no additional greenhouse effect.
They help to protect finite fossil resources such as crude oil, natural gas and coal.
They make a contribution to sustained raw materials and energy supplies.
There are many advantages in using products based on renewable raw materials in areas with an enhanced environment awareness.
Renewable raw materials also benefit rural areas.
In addition, TRIANGEL also offers experience from the production and use of substitute fuel from waste products.
