The Juanita’s Hostel (“Hostal Juanita”) is located in one of the most historical area near the center of Ibiza, a few minutes walk from the medieval walls of "Dalt Vila". Its excellent location allows guests to enjoy a pleasant stroll through the heart of the old town and along the seafront, with easy access to the best entertainment Ibiza can offer: bars, restaurants and clubs .The Hostal Juanita is ideally located just a short walk from both bus and ferry stations.
