Frequently asked questions:
I'd like to make a reservation.
What should I do? 1. First you can check our Availability page, to see if the desired time frame is available.
3. You'd have to make a money transfer of at least 50% of the total amount to our Dutch bank account.
4. Notify us by email with the reference number of your bank transfer.
5. Fill out the "register" form with the personal details of the travelers.
Children have to pay as well? One child up to 4 years of age can stay in the room without any extra cost. (No extra bed).
Does Cachama Negra have a restaurant?
No, we don't have restaurant service.
Do you have any discounts?
Yes, with a stay of 6 nights, you'd pay only 5 nights.
How do we reach Cachama Negra? From Maracay you can either take a bus or taxi "por puesto".
You can find travel information on the Address-page of this site. Suggestion: print out the Choroní-map on the Address-page.
Do you have private parking space? Yes, we do. There is one spot for every room and cabaña, and two spots for the vacational home.
What time is check-in time on the day of arrival?
If the room was ocupied the night before, you can enter after 3pm. We can store your luggage while you are going to the beach.
If the room was not ocupied the night before, you can enter from 10am.
What time is check-out time? Check out time for the rooms and cabaña is at 1pm.
Check out time for the vacational home is at 11am.
How far away are you from the beach? It's about a 15 minutes walk.
I have a small dog, can I bring it? No. We don't accept domestic animals.
Is there an ATM or bank in Choroní? There's one bank, Banco Nacional de Crédito, with two ATM's. However, the ATM's don't seem to work well with foreign cards.
The towels are not to be taken to the beach.
Do the showers have hot water? THe showers of the double rooms, and the cabaña do have hot water.
The showers of the vacational house and the outdoors showers have natural water.
Are the rooms cleaned on a daily basis? The rooms and the cabaña are cleaned daily.
The vacational home is cleaned before and after occupation.
You'll find cleaning utensils in the house.
Yes, we do have a small generator, which allows us to power the posada, in case of power loss. However, with the generator active, we cannot use air-condition units. Al rooms do have ceiling fans.
Do you have a pool? In Cachama Negra we don't have a pool.
Do you have internet?
Yes, we offer free wifi (wireless internet) to our guests.
How many rooms, cabañas, houses do you have? We have two double rooms, one cabaña for 3 o 4 people, and one vacational home up to 8 people.
We are traveling with a large group. How many people can stay in Cachama Negra? In Cachama Negra you can stay with a maximum of 16 people.
Is there a kitchen available for the guests? For the guests of the rooms and cabaña there is no kitchen available.
The vacational home does have a fully equipped kitchen.
What does the kitchen in the vacational home have? The kitchen is equipped with fridge, blender, pots, plates, utensils, etc. Well, everything you need to cook.
The rooms and the cabaña:
There are 2 rooms with double beds for rent in the main house.
We also have a cabaña for 3 or 4 people.
Both rooms have private bathrooms with shower and hot water, towels and soap, as well as daily cleaning.
They also have television, aircondition and ceiling fans.
We also have a “cabaña” for 3 or 4 people.
The cabaña has one large room with one double bed, and two single beds. It has aircondition, television and private bathroom with shower and hot water, towels and soap, as well as daily cleaning.
Outside is veranda with a table and chairs.
