In Quinta Cachama Negra you can enjoy your stay in Choroní to the max. We offer lodging in a pleasant and friendly environment, with just a few rooms, for more quietness and privacy, whilst only a few minutes walk to the “malecón” (boulevard), and a 15 minutes stroll to the beach!
Quinta Cachama Negra is the home of André Loerakker, from The Netherlands. We are situated in the authentic colonial village of Puerto Colombia, Choroní, near some of the most beautiful beaches of Venezuela. Enjoy swimming, snorkeling, diving, boat-trips, and the spectacular mountains in the area, with beautiful trails ideal for birdwatching and, last but not least, the friendly villagers and the fine food and drinks.
We have 2 comfortable double rooms, with both air-condition and ceiling fans, television and private bathroom with shower and hot water.
There is one “cabaña” for 3 or 4 people. It has air-condition, television and private bathroom with shower and hot water.
We also rent out a fully equipped house, in which you can stay with a group up to 8 people.
The house consists of a living room with television, a well equipped kitchen, two bedrooms for four people. Both rooms have television, air-condition, as well as fans.
