It’s been 130 years since the foundation of the Xiquets de Tarragona (before, Colla La Mercè), and 45 years since the reunification and creation of the actual striped-shirt group, the oldest association of that kind in Tarragona.
An original view of the castellers’ groups through history and an analysis of the intern, long, tough process of reunification of the two organizations that ends with the social rising of the tradition of a renewed colla, with nothing to envy of the main ones.
