Case of study introduced by director Claudia Llosa and TVE’s archive director Dolors Gonzalo. This film is part of the episode series 50 years of... started by TVE that has opened the audiovisual archive of the channel to 15 prestigious directors.
By studying the way traditions evolve, 50 años de tradiciones analyses the changes and interests of the Spanish society.
The reason behind the practice or abandonment of a tradition reveals the milieu of the collective need for it.
