There are individuals who have changed the world, and Vidal Sassoon is indeed one of them. This is the revealing story of a man who changed the world with his scissors.
In this film we discover that the hairdresser behind the hairstyles of The Beatles, Mia Farrow and the celebrities of the 1970s fought courageously to make his way from an orphanage in London, where he was raised, to the spotlights of international fame. And all thanks to his hair salons and products.
