Memorimage holds a workshop for everyone who has interest in learning how to tell a story through a documentary.
Life provides us with intimate stories, family stories, in first person ... stories we live with every day.
This workshop provides the necessary knowledge to learn how to build and tell these stories through a documentary.
Do you want to tell a story? Which is your story and its key points? Who are the characters?
How would you film it? Learn the key elements for the preparation of a documentary.
