The beautiful Villa Isuledda Preziosa is located in San Teodoro, one of the most popular holiday destinations on the northeastern coast of Sardinia.
The color of the sea and the fine white sandy beaches make this place one of the summer top destinations.
Villa Isuledda Preziosa is a beautiful recently built villa, situated on the slopes of the village right in front of Isuledda beach, which is just 150 m. Completely immersed in greenery, the villa enjoys a breathtaking view on the Marine Protected Area of Tavolara and develops on two levels with 2 separate apartments:
On the Ground Floor, with separate entrance, there is a double bedroom, a bedroom with two single low beds, a room with a bunk bed and a single bed, two bathrooms, a living area with kitchen, a patio with table and chairs, a small garden and outdoor shower.
Both levels are well furnished with LCD TV with satellite and digital terrestrial television system, air conditioning in all rooms, washing machine, oven and dishwasher.
Extra bed not available, pets are not allowed.
PLEASE NOTE: only families with children and couples are allowed in this villa.
