Immersed in a pristine environment, the Lanthia Resort is located in Santa Maria Navarrese, inside a huge park with all the botanical species representative of the mediterranean vegetation.
It is located in Ogliastra, in the Gulf of Orosei, on the east coast of Sardinia.
The Resort is a few meters from the beach, opposite to the sea, with a beautiful pinewood.
Small fraction of Baunei, Santa Maria Navarrese became a holiday place of considerable prestige, mainly due to the recent marina and hotels.
The hotel is located in Santa Maria Navarrese, in Baunei, 14 km from the port of Arbatax, 145 km from the port and airport of Cagliari, and 190 km from the port and airport of Olbia.
Lanthia Resort has 18 double rooms and double/single use on 2 floors, all with satellite TV, telephone, safe, air conditioning.
Internet on request.
The restaurant offers tastings of the culinary tradition of Sardinia. Breakfast buffet, dinner with table service.
