In the heart of Sardinia by the sea stands the Horse Country Hotel Resort Congress & Spa. Behind the Arcidano mountains and the Giara di Gesturi plain,both rich in flora and fauna.
The beaches are intact and nature is still untouched: pink flamingoes and other rare species live in this mainly unknown part of the island.
A wild and pristine nature is the ideal place for long walks, hiking, trekking with the help of experienced guides.
The Horse Country is a major Equestrian Center where every year races and equestrian events with international significance take place.
The Horse Contry also offers an area of 700 square meters dedicated to relaxation and well-being.
Modern and equipped facilities for personalised treatments as massages, reflexology, lymphatic drainage etc. No less important is the Conference Centre, with a wide conference rooms, equipped with the latest technology, which can accommodate up to 1,000 people.
The Horse Country Hotel Resort Congress & Spa can be easily reached from all the main ports and airports in Sardinia.
Available upon request (not available from 01/01 to 11/06 and from 11/09 to 22/12).
