Available at breakfast, lunch and dinner time. Buffet service during the high season.
L'Aragosta Restaurant an elegant and refined cosy restaurant with stone fireplace, offers local and international dishes with à la carte menu.
Spiaggia Restaurant, close to the beach, with breathtaking views to enjoy the sea breeze until late.
The restaurant is open only during summer months.
Is the ideal place to relax and make new friends while sipping a beer as a true cowboy.
"Il Cedro" American Bar placed in the resort piazzetta, surrounded by a pinewood, is the meeting place for a drink or a cocktail during piano bar nights.
Mirtillo Bar placed in the central hall, next to the indoor pool.
Open during the winter months.
Bar Tropicana located in front of the "Tropicana" pool, is a snack bar open mainly during the warmer months of the year.
