The complex Tanka Village Resortis located in the South West part of Sardinia just outside the town of Villasimius, which is 1 km away. Villasimius is a spectacular tourist destination able to offer at the same time environmental, archaeological, artistically, folk attractions and a varied and well know gastronomic tradition.
The wide and cosy Lobby located between the arrival/departure area has the Reception, information and counter.
The bedrooms and common areas are joined among them by small paths and pedestrian areas and bicycle paths where cars are forbidden.
Common services are in the central part of the village, not far away from the rooms and with direct access to the beach from which are at approx 50 mts.
Architectural barriers have practically disappeared in the common areas in order to allow the access to everybody to all of the services.
The distribution of the units, totally integrated in the landscape, has been done avoiding concentration and with the idea of making the Tanka Village Resort the perfect destination to be away from everyday chaos and stress. Tanka Village is proud of the unique eating experience it offers in terms of variety and quality of service.
Five restaurants, one for children, within the resort in order to offer to guests different lunch and dinner experiences.
It is at 54 km from the airport of Cagliari-Elmas.
The residence formula offers 257 Bungalow located near the sports area, in the hills of the resort (panoramic position to the Bay of “Simius”), distance to the beach from 300 to 800 mt.
They have a bedroom with two/three beds, kitchenette, bathroom with shower and hairdryer, telephone, fridge, air conditioning, sat TV, safe.
The Baby club and mini club for children are divided by age, guarantee fun for children and peace and freedom for parents.
The Conference centre is near the common areas of the Village and has 6 meeting rooms with technical equipment.
Sailing school, mountain bike rental, boat rental. Diving centre at the beach.
In the heart of the Village, very close to services, there are numerous commercial activities (newsstand, market, boutique, laundry, etc).
The structure has 5 restaurants, among which one for children.
Pets are not allowed.
