Scuderie De Morimenta Farm house is on a plateau in panoramic view, totally immersed in nature. The structure is divided into two bodies: one made from an old building includes 6 rooms, reception, open fireplace, TV room and breakfast lounge all in a rustic style; The second body of more recent construction includes 6 bedrooms.
A few steps are the stables and riding school.
The position of the structure allows in a maximum of half an hour drive to visit almost all the archaeological sites and mining of the south west of Sardinia (Porto Flavia, Grotta di Santa Barbara, the Temple of Anthas, nuraghe Seruci etc..) And most of the beaches.
The property is located in Morimenta in the town of Gonnesa about 60 km from the port and airport of Cagliari.
Scuderie De Morimenta has 12 rooms. Of the 6 rooms at the old body 3 are located on the ground floor, topped by a pergola and air conditioned, 3 are located on the first floor and are also air conditioned.
The 6 rooms at the new body are all on the same level, all equipped with veranda, but are not air conditioned.
