Southern Sardinia: 5 km of sandy coast in the western part of the beautiful Gulf of Cagliari. Apartments Santa Margherita di Pula, gives you the opportunity to stay in one of the most exclusive and popular places of the island.
An enjoyable holiday rich in sun, sea and culture - the precious ruins of the ancient city of Nora are just a few miles away - at a areasonable price. Choose the quality of our residences, placed inside a large pine wood overlooking a stretch of endless sea.
Our residences
La Pineta Residence , located in the heart of a pine forest from which derives its name, slopes down to the white sandy beach and a crystal clear sea a few hundred meters away. All the apartments are located in terraced houses complex and have an equipped outdoor space (balcony or patio).
The apartments, divided into bilo and trilo types, are furnished according to the taste of each owner.
The shallow and clear waters onto which the structures overlook, offer a unique scenario.
Bilo and trilo type apartments are all furnished and equipped according to the taste of each owner.
Cala Verde Residence is characterized by the presence of paths flanking the houses and leading to the white sandy beach. Tennis courts and games for children are located inside the residence.
Bilo and trilo type apartments, located inside of terraced houses, are equipped in a practical and functional way and furnished according to the taste of each owner.
The vegetation surrounding the area also creates pleasant shadowy areas, a real cool oasis during summer days.
The crystal clear and shallow waters are ideal for a family holiday.
The final accommodation of the customer is at the travel service provider discretion, referenced in the Apartments Santa Margherita di Pula offer.
By booking the Apartments Santa Margherita di Pula offer, the customer claims to be aware of the accommodation structures, its characteristics and their location thanks to the specifications in this web page.
The name of the accommodation where the customer will spend his/her holiday will be announced at the arrival.
