Located inside a unique property of three houses of different sizes, CASA IN PIETRA is in the heart of the Costa Smeralda, in a natural setting of rare beauty among granite rocks and the Mediterranean maquis.
The house is only 140 meters away from the famous Capriccioli beach, which can be reached on foot through a path among the mediterranean maquis. The entrance and the shared garden is characterised by granite pillars and heavy wooden doors; guests can park their car (max. 3) under the wood and bamboo shed, on the right of the gate.
Some shaded areas offer romantic spaces, while a beautiful panoramic view enjoys the highest points. As well as the garden, the houses are rich in detail, both in their furnishing and decorations.
Capriccioli, one of the most beautiful bays of the Costa Smeralda, is 22 km from Olbia maritime port and airport; 4 Km from Porto Cervo; 12 Km from Porto Rotondo.
The house, of about 60 sqm and lined with stone, is located on the left side of the shared garden entering the gate and has a large living area with kitchenette. The furnishings recall the light blue and yellow colors of the walls. Two bedrooms, one double and one with bunk bed, small private patio with table, chairs and sunbed to enjoy the tranquility of the place; a small barbecue for excellent grilled foods; covered parking place.
Alghero is one of the best known cities of Northern Sardinia for its medieval castles fascination but also it is one of the most chosen vacations cities.
The shores are full of inlets and caves interrupted by white sandy beaches.
It is simple to arrive to Alghero from the airport of Fertilia (located at approx 13 Km), and from the port of Porto Torres, located at approx 47 Km.
Beds: 6+2
Distance to the beach: 6 km.
Heating, air conditioning, private garden, parking, veranda.
