Located on the first floor, consists of a wide lounge with separate kitchenette, one double bedroom, one single bedroom with French bed, one shower bathroom.
Air conditioned, the apartment provides a pleasant stay all year round for families up to 4 people (possibility of baby cot in the living area).
A few meters from the house, along a small private path, you can get to the beach and the lovely bays surrounded by rocks shaped by the wind.
The apartment has washing machine, mini-dishwasher, water reserve and TV.
